hint: a child process was killed by SIGSYS inside the kernel sandbox; children inherit the file and network rules, so it may have been refused something (see --kernel-sandbox-report); grant the child's access to this program, or turn it off for the run with --kernel-sandbox=off, or in deno.json with "permissions": { "kernelSandbox": "off" }
